# Spell mastery (CR 207.2c): Fiery Impulse deals 3 instead of 2 once two or more instant and/or sorcery cards are in its
# controller's graveyard when it resolves. Bot1 casts Shock at Bot2 (graveyard: 1 card), then Fiery Impulse on Concealing
# Curtains (toughness 4): one card is not enough, so only 2 damage is marked. The Impulse and Shock now make two, so a
# second Fiery Impulse deals 3 and kills Drannith Magistrate (toughness 3), which 2 damage would not. The spell itself
# is on the stack, not in the graveyard, while it resolves.

